{"id":"sl/jyx0ra1s","index":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/4v2ps7ql","name":"Title and Content"},"title":"‹#›","elements":[{"id":"sh/k72t43md","kind":"textbox","text":"‹#›","position":{"left":1184.18,"top":659.24,"width":54.48,"height":25.33},"style":{"fontSize":13.33,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#000000","alignment":"right"}},{"id":"sh/l8bad83y","kind":"textbox","text":"Diseño Inicial\n","position":{"left":41.33,"top":36.12,"width":1197.33,"height":109.97},"style":{"fontSize":46,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#44515C","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}},{"id":"sh/ah0byt4b","kind":"textbox","text":"Programación Eficiente · Parcial 1","position":{"left":41.33,"top":659.31,"width":374.67,"height":25.33},"style":{"fontSize":13.3,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#70808D","alignment":"left"}},{"id":"sh/bi9s7ylw","kind":"textbox","text":"Arquitectura de componentes:\nmodelos.py: Modelado formal del dominio (dataclasses con inmutabilidad y slots).\ngenerador.py: Generador de datos sintéticos pseudoaleatorios reproducibles (random.seed(42)).\nalgoritmos_ordenamiento.py: Aislamiento de los algoritmos de ordenamiento.\ndetectores.py: Diferentes estrategias de detección para permitir testing comparativo con las mismas firmas.\nmedicion.py y perfilado.py: Infraestructura de benchmarking, profiling y métricas.\n\n","position":{"left":41.34,"top":137.32,"width":1197.32,"height":432.03},"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#44515C","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}},{"id":"im/pobmp4j6","kind":"image","position":{"left":657.33,"top":413.53,"width":384.41,"height":255.94}}]}
